# Code is LF: every plugin, test and tool script (2026-11-07: the last 83 CRLF ones turned to LF, nothing else changed in them;
# the patch scripts still keep whatever a file uses, so one written CRLF by an editor stays as it is). The editor's data/*.json,
# the docs and js/libs keep their own bytes. Git leaves every file exactly as it is instead of normalizing on commit/checkout,
# so a checkout never silently rewrites a file the editor or a script wrote.
* -text
